ASSISTANT PRODUCER: ICHINAO NAGAI

03:12.960 --> 03:15.960
PRODUCERS:

03:12.960 --> 03:15.960
YASHIMA TOKUHARA

03:12.960 --> 03:15.960
SATSUKI MIZUNO

03:12.960 --> 03:15.960
YOSHIHIKO FUJISAWA

03:22.010 --> 03:25.010
DIRECTED BY: MAMORU KANBE

03:38.640 --> 03:39.740
Come on, just give up.

03:41.150 --> 03:42.880
Wh-What is it?

03:43.500 --> 03:44.740
What do you want with me?

03:45.330 --> 03:47.140
Nothing.
And we bear no ill will.

03:47.140 --> 03:48.120
Not towards you, anyway.

03:48.710 --> 03:51.420
Then why have you been chasing after me?

04:03.970 --> 04:06.300
Alright, show yourself.

04:06.860 --> 04:08.810
B-But I haven’t...

04:20.700 --> 04:22.400
My face... oh God, my face...

04:28.720 --> 04:30.210
Decide quickly.

04:30.720 --> 04:32.350
Will you come with me...

04:32.350 --> 04:34.000
or be destroyed right here?

04:41.330 --> 04:43.330
Come out right now!

04:43.330 --> 04:46.190
It would be a shame to mess up this girl’s sweet face.

04:46.190 --> 04:47.600
I’ll take care of this.

04:48.680 --> 04:50.350
Hang on a minute, this one is mine.

04:50.350 --> 04:51.180
I said I’ll do it!

04:58.840 --> 05:03.570
Come out or I’ll freeze you in the host’s body
and smash the both of you to pieces.

05:04.460 --> 05:05.070
Horrific...

05:14.000 --> 05:15.040
A baby?!

05:15.620 --> 05:17.010
Enma!

05:17.650 --> 05:18.880
I told you to leave it to me.

05:36.900 --> 05:38.770
It took me by surprise...

05:40.680 --> 05:43.300
But I think it’s over now.

05:48.290 --> 05:48.860
What now?

05:51.490 --> 05:53.950
I’m just enjoying the view.

05:56.210 --> 05:59.960
It’s awful, I’m covered all over in ash.

06:01.210 --> 06:03.300
It won’t come off...

06:04.340 --> 06:06.630
Let’s go. Our job is done.

06:06.630 --> 06:09.140
Don’t try and act cool now, you pervert.

06:21.080 --> 06:23.510
Coming back after such a long time,

06:23.510 --> 06:26.240
it seems this world is more disturbed than it was before.

06:27.020 --> 06:30.740
I hate all this bother, each and every time.

06:32.090 --> 06:34.810
There’s no choice, it’s our job.

06:34.810 --> 06:36.750
But I hate it anyway...

06:38.160 --> 06:41.170
Kwapaa!

06:42.360 --> 06:44.380
That’s not nice!

06:44.380 --> 06:45.680
Oh, it’s you.

06:46.960 --> 06:50.430
Out of the blue like that is not acceptable,
totally out of the blue!

06:51.540 --> 06:52.880
What’s that get-up?

06:52.880 --> 06:54.680
Oh what, this?

06:54.680 --> 06:57.680
Well, in this world my true appearance would seem too shocking.

06:55.180 --> 06:57.430
SPECIAL SERVICE
DAY

06:55.180 --> 06:57.430
CUTIE HIGH

06:57.430 --> 06:57.560
RAUNCHY

06:57.430 --> 06:57.560
COSTUME

06:57.430 --> 06:57.560
PARTY

07:01.380 --> 07:02.690
Hold on...

07:03.360 --> 07:05.150
Hello, Kawae speaking.

07:05.150 --> 07:06.010
What’s that?

07:06.010 --> 07:07.880
It’s called a cell phone.

07:06.690 --> 07:09.440
How can I help you, sir?

07:08.600 --> 07:11.150
All the humans seem to have one these days.

07:10.280 --> 07:12.760
One more round and then I’ll head back.

07:12.740 --> 07:15.720
CUTIE HIGH

07:12.760 --> 07:13.690
Yes, of course.

07:13.690 --> 07:16.090
Okay. See you later.

07:17.380 --> 07:20.660
I’m supposed to be the club’s salesperson in a mascot costume.

07:20.660 --> 07:24.510
This club has got some pretty sweet special services.

07:24.510 --> 07:25.690
Special services?

07:26.830 --> 07:29.230
Come on, you know what it is.

07:29.230 --> 07:31.430
All those pretty young women will...

07:32.750 --> 07:34.880
What’s that? Pretty young women?

07:39.300 --> 07:39.730
Huh?

07:39.730 --> 07:41.060
What special services?

07:41.060 --> 07:42.950
Oh, you know.

07:42.950 --> 07:45.140
They do a bit of this and a bit of that.

07:45.140 --> 07:45.970
Yeah, and then?

07:45.970 --> 07:48.820
Some will even do it in that special way.

07:52.490 --> 07:54.210
Kapaeru!

07:54.210 --> 07:56.410
Please refrain from teaching Enma about such twisted things!

07:58.500 --> 08:02.410
B-But Yukihime, this is part of my job.

08:03.530 --> 08:05.780
That’s right! You know...

08:05.780 --> 08:10.050
it’s a part of my gathering information
about human psyche and behavior.

08:10.760 --> 08:12.040
Oh, really?

08:18.990 --> 08:21.930
Anyway, tonight’s job seems to have gone well.

08:21.930 --> 08:24.310
He was a vicious creature, wasn’t he?

08:24.740 --> 08:26.890
Not as bad as you said he would be.

08:27.880 --> 08:29.820
Yuki-chan got stripped down, mind you.

08:29.820 --> 08:31.240
Don’t call me Yuki-chan!

08:31.240 --> 08:32.870
I am Yukihime!

08:32.870 --> 08:35.820
Besides, that was all your doing!

08:35.820 --> 08:39.460
Well anyway, all’s well and we got our target.

08:39.460 --> 08:44.350
Just what I’d expect from the highly esteemed
Prince of the Underworld, Boss Enma.

08:44.350 --> 08:46.040
So, what’s our next target?

08:46.040 --> 08:48.720
Well actually, it’s rather hard...

08:48.720 --> 08:52.060
Recently it’s getting harder and harder
just to pick up their trail.

08:56.540 --> 08:59.100
A city where the darkness has disappeared...

08:59.710 --> 09:02.770
Damn, those humans...

09:06.860 --> 09:08.560
Oh, Ms. Chigusa.

09:11.120 --> 09:15.570
I see. Tomorrow at 6,
at the usual spot on Park Avenue.

09:17.080 --> 09:20.630
But he better not be like that
old creep you sent me last time.

09:22.140 --> 09:23.340
Oh?

09:23.340 --> 09:25.840
The young president of an IT company? Really?

09:25.840 --> 09:26.330
No!

09:26.330 --> 09:27.920
Oh, excuse me.

09:28.830 --> 09:31.910
Hey, don’t surprise me like that.

09:31.910 --> 09:33.990
Yeah, right. See you later.

09:33.990 --> 09:35.700
Oh, Papa?

09:35.700 --> 09:38.770
I’m sorry, I thought you were in your room.

09:38.770 --> 09:43.160
I’ve promised a friend I’d meet her
after school tomorrow to go shopping.

09:43.160 --> 09:45.010
May I come back a bit late?

09:46.500 --> 09:48.400
As long as you’re not too late.

09:48.400 --> 09:50.110
Yes, I know.

11:00.380 --> 11:02.390
Wh-What’s this?

11:42.980 --> 11:43.890
Misato...

11:45.240 --> 11:47.730
Lola has grown into such a wonderful girl.

11:55.550 --> 11:58.180
She resembles you more and more each day.

12:05.930 --> 12:08.090
That’s weird, dozing off in the bath.

13:49.340 --> 13:50.900
What’s... this...?

13:58.350 --> 14:01.700
“To completely solve any supernatural or mysterious incidents...”

14:01.700 --> 14:03.330
“Enma’s Detective Agency.”

14:04.040 --> 14:05.320
Very up to date, eh?

14:05.320 --> 14:07.340
Is that up to date?

14:07.340 --> 14:10.020
This should help us get some leads
as to their whereabouts.

14:10.020 --> 14:12.140
Kapa-chan, you’ve got mail.

14:14.410 --> 14:15.500
Boss Enma!

14:15.500 --> 14:16.980
Ooof!

14:17.870 --> 14:20.540
Kappa, you Toad-Sprite!
Stop goofing off!

14:21.780 --> 14:23.430
W-We’ve got a case.

14:24.710 --> 14:29.960
“From Sat-chan, who loves Kapaeru,”
with a heart mark in brackets...

14:24.710 --> 14:30.720
SAT-CHAN

14:24.710 --> 14:30.720
FROM SAT-CHAN, WHO
LOVES KAPAERU

14:24.710 --> 14:30.720
How’s it going,
Kapa-chan? I’m doing
great! (^^)v
Big news!
According to recent
rumors going around,
hard to believe but

14:32.820 --> 14:34.560
Ah, you know...

14:34.560 --> 14:39.930
I asked my mail-friend to collect information
about any bizzare rumors.

14:40.470 --> 14:45.250
Sat-chan is a girl with a certain knack for that kind of thing.

14:45.250 --> 14:47.070
What is a “mail-friend”?

14:49.960 --> 14:55.660
Honestly, you two really don’t have a clue
about modern human society, do you?!

14:56.720 --> 14:57.830
Just tell us the case.

14:59.790 --> 15:02.580
According to the information from Sat-chan...

15:02.580 --> 15:03.830
recently...

15:03.830 --> 15:05.550
Something smells.

15:05.550 --> 15:06.380
What?

15:06.380 --> 15:08.710
Oh, are you awake, Chapeauji?

15:08.710 --> 15:12.600
It reeks, that’s the smell of an evil spirit.

15:14.390 --> 15:16.620
Yeah, everything’s been arranged, so...

15:18.110 --> 15:19.690
What are you talking about now?

15:20.000 --> 15:22.470
I think the fee is quite reasonable.

15:22.470 --> 15:24.200
I sent you her photo, right?

15:24.200 --> 15:26.690
She’s half German and a natural blonde, I’m telling you.

15:26.690 --> 15:27.870
If you’re not interested...

15:29.690 --> 15:33.070
Right, well then,
I’ll get her to wait on Park Avenue.

16:05.170 --> 16:07.020
It seems we just missed it.

16:07.020 --> 16:08.620
Shit...

16:08.620 --> 16:11.740
Hey, Geezer, a bit quicker...

16:13.770 --> 16:15.740
Huh, useless old fart.

16:16.290 --> 16:19.120
Can it really be true?

16:19.120 --> 16:20.000
What?

16:20.000 --> 16:21.240
See for yourself.

16:21.750 --> 16:24.250
While the flu is scary, there’s
something more scary rumored
recently...

16:21.750 --> 16:24.250
A vampire!

16:21.750 --> 16:24.250
So many

16:21.750 --> 16:24.250
sightings!

16:21.750 --> 16:24.250
So terrifying!

16:21.750 --> 16:24.250
All your blood sucked out!

16:22.620 --> 16:24.250
A vampire?

16:24.560 --> 16:28.110
You know, an incident in Setagaya recently.

16:28.110 --> 16:29.750
The series of murders in the street.

16:29.750 --> 16:33.590
Oh, that case where the victim’s blood
had all been drained out?

16:34.220 --> 16:37.030
It’s said there was an eyewitness
who saw a man with a black cloak...

16:37.030 --> 16:41.200
sucking away on the victim’s neck,
gulping down blood.

16:42.850 --> 16:44.350
A black cloak...

16:45.920 --> 16:47.500
archetypal...

16:49.870 --> 16:51.390
Well, thanks a lot.

16:51.390 --> 16:52.900
You’ve been a great help.

16:52.900 --> 16:54.350
What will this appear in?

16:54.350 --> 16:57.370
In Yellow Weekly magazine in a feature article titled...

16:57.900 --> 16:59.590
“Legendary Urban Ghost Stories” or something.

16:59.590 --> 17:00.510
See you.

17:05.780 --> 17:09.060
Hah, a sudden interview without giving us a thing?

17:09.060 --> 17:10.540
That’s cool.

17:10.540 --> 17:13.900
It’s rare to get interviewed for a magazine.

17:13.900 --> 17:15.510
Anyway, I’ve got a strict curfew.

17:16.000 --> 17:17.810
So I have to be home by 9 o’clock.

17:17.810 --> 17:19.320
Okay, okay.

17:20.260 --> 17:21.780
Any scary rumors?

17:21.780 --> 17:23.780
I’ll treat you to tea or something.

17:23.780 --> 17:25.180
If you have anything...

17:26.670 --> 17:30.780
We’ve heard about a woman in a red dress
who appears in an abandoned house, right?

17:30.780 --> 17:32.780
A woman in a red dress in an abandoned house?

17:32.780 --> 17:34.010
Tell me more.

17:34.010 --> 17:36.100
Come on, let’s go.

17:36.100 --> 17:37.340
Oh, okay.

17:37.340 --> 17:39.620
Wait up! At least tell me where that place is!

17:44.750 --> 17:49.430
Regarding the case where a man was brutally
murdered in an apartment in Shinjuku...

17:49.430 --> 17:53.290
the Metropolitan Police Department
arrested a suspect early this morning...

17:53.290 --> 17:56.720
Midori Akaki,
the victim’s room-mate, was fleeing.

17:55.130 --> 17:57.150
That person is a brutal murderer?

17:56.720 --> 17:58.610
The suspect, in a deep state of shock...

17:58.610 --> 18:03.240
claims to have no memory of the incident
and denies having any involvement.

18:00.240 --> 18:01.760
Forget it.

18:01.760 --> 18:06.630
What’s more important for me is the woman in a red dress in an abandoned house.

18:04.070 --> 18:07.310
And next, tomorrow’s weather forecast.

18:07.310 --> 18:14.990
The Kanto Region will be sunny with some clouds later...

18:14.990 --> 18:17.090
A supernatural detective?

18:14.990 --> 18:19.240
TO COMPLETELY SOLVE
ANY SUPERNATURAL OR
MYSTERIOUS INCIDENTS,
ENMA'S DETECTIVE
AGENCY

18:17.710 --> 18:19.240
Is this a joke?

18:23.460 --> 18:24.990
I guess it’s a story...

18:26.200 --> 18:29.120
It’s the first time I’ve ever touched natural blonde hair.

18:30.180 --> 18:32.350
It’s because my father is German.

18:33.250 --> 18:35.320
What does your old man do?

18:35.320 --> 18:36.860
He’s a university professor.

18:36.860 --> 18:39.930
Wow, you’re quite the proper young lady.

18:40.470 --> 18:46.050
My father’s especially strict because
he’s a single father and I’m his only child.

18:47.420 --> 18:49.590
I bet you act like the perfect young lady at home.

18:51.700 --> 18:52.820
By the way...

18:52.820 --> 18:53.860
What?

18:54.180 --> 18:56.890
That story before, about the vampire...

18:57.490 --> 18:58.350
do you believe it?

18:58.350 --> 19:01.510
As if! It’s just a rumor that’s going round...

19:02.280 --> 19:04.390
Why, do you believe it?

19:06.880 --> 19:09.890
No, I don’t mean that, but...

19:09.890 --> 19:11.120
You’re a strange one.

19:21.780 --> 19:23.240
I’ve got to get home...

19:45.760 --> 19:47.190
I fell asleep...

19:54.330 --> 19:56.460
Wh-What’s this?

20:08.860 --> 20:11.440
I don’t believe it... what’s happened...?

20:15.740 --> 20:17.520
She’s still not home yet...

20:20.080 --> 20:24.200
I bet she’s out again with that low-life, Chigusa.

20:29.560 --> 20:30.780
I should tell the police...

20:32.870 --> 20:35.290
But then Papa will find out I’ve been lying...

20:36.600 --> 20:38.240
And if he finds out about my job...

20:39.920 --> 20:42.420
Ms. Chigusa

20:45.710 --> 20:48.570
Oh, Ms. Chigusa? What should I do?
That client!

20:48.570 --> 20:50.860
Is this a friend of Chigusa’s?

20:50.860 --> 20:52.780
Ah... well...

20:52.780 --> 20:53.980
Chigusa was...

20:55.270 --> 20:57.150
last night Chigusa was...

20:57.150 --> 20:58.320
What?

21:00.540 --> 21:01.230
Can’t be...

21:07.820 --> 21:10.290
ENMA'S
DETECTIVE
AGENCY

21:12.850 --> 21:13.590
Who is it?

21:13.590 --> 21:16.750
Um... I saw your flier posted up and...

21:21.630 --> 21:24.050
ENMA'S
DETECTIVE
AGENCY

21:24.370 --> 21:26.810
I’m sorry that I startled you.

21:26.810 --> 21:31.400
I’m the agency’s mascot, “Pretty Kapa-chan.”

21:31.400 --> 21:34.510
I wear this for advertising purposes.

21:36.170 --> 21:37.020
Here you go.

21:41.270 --> 21:43.310
Oh, thank you...

21:43.830 --> 21:45.030
What do you want?

21:47.970 --> 21:50.690
Why is everyone dressed up so strangely...?

21:50.690 --> 21:52.270
What? What did you say?

21:52.270 --> 21:53.430
Speak clearly, man!

21:53.430 --> 21:55.580
Ah, um... well...

21:56.370 --> 21:59.370
Boss, remember this is a client.

21:59.370 --> 22:01.040
Don’t scare him off.

22:01.040 --> 22:03.120
Who’s scaring him?

22:03.120 --> 22:04.170
I’m just being normal!

22:04.550 --> 22:06.350
You’re going out to the back room.

22:06.350 --> 22:07.350
Why?

22:07.350 --> 22:08.750
Kapaeru, please take care of our guest.

22:08.750 --> 22:09.830
My... my ear.

22:09.830 --> 22:11.120
Gotcha.

22:09.830 --> 22:10.680
So noisy.

22:10.680 --> 22:11.430
Ow, my ear, ow...

22:11.120 --> 22:14.630
Okay, may I ask your name and occupation to begin with?

22:11.430 --> 22:13.400
Be quiet for a while.

22:15.240 --> 22:18.480
My name is Schtrolheim Heinrich,

22:18.480 --> 22:20.940
and I teach German history at a university.

22:21.840 --> 22:25.060
I see, and what can we do for you?

22:25.490 --> 22:29.490
It’s my daughter...
I want you to find her.

22:31.380 --> 22:32.570
What am I going to do?

22:33.280 --> 22:36.330
The police are probably at my house right now...

22:41.360 --> 22:42.340
Are you by yourself?

22:44.450 --> 22:45.940
So this is Lorelai?

22:45.940 --> 22:48.720
She’s inherited good European and Japanese features.

22:48.720 --> 22:51.030
I don’t think she’s anything special.

22:51.030 --> 22:52.800
I circulated this picture on the Internet...

22:52.800 --> 22:55.590
and someone claimed to have spotted her in Shibuya.

22:55.590 --> 22:57.750
Huh? What’s “circulated”?

22:57.750 --> 22:59.300
Is there some kind of event on?

22:59.300 --> 23:00.420
Must be costume dressing.

23:00.420 --> 23:02.110
There’s a lot of it nowadays.

23:02.110 --> 23:04.150
That’s it. I’m calling it quits.

23:04.150 --> 23:05.560
Me too...

23:05.560 --> 23:07.580
it’s so hot and sticky, I could die.

23:07.580 --> 23:09.040
Hey, hang on a minute.

23:09.040 --> 23:10.700
We already got paid half up front.

23:11.070 --> 23:11.990
What did you say?

23:11.990 --> 23:13.280
Well, ah, it’s just that, em...

23:13.280 --> 23:16.460
you’ll be bored just hanging around the office, right?

23:17.510 --> 23:20.600
My job isn’t looking for missing persons.

23:20.600 --> 23:22.710
At the least it’s outside our specialty.

23:22.710 --> 23:24.900
Oh, please wait a moment.

23:24.900 --> 23:26.530
Hey, that blonde girl...

23:26.530 --> 23:27.960
Hey, Boss!

23:29.310 --> 23:31.470
Well anyway, for the time being...

23:38.000 --> 23:39.780
Wow, it’s not dyed at all.

23:40.690 --> 23:44.410
I’ve been bullied since childhood because I look like a foreigner...

23:45.320 --> 23:46.900
there’s nothing good about it...

23:46.900 --> 23:48.800
What are you talking about?

23:48.800 --> 23:50.530
You’re absolutely gorgeous.

23:54.310 --> 23:57.660
So you told the father about
the hotel that she entered with a man?

23:57.660 --> 24:00.460
No, I couldn’t get through, so I just left a message.

24:00.760 --> 24:03.640
What, you just left it at that and came back?

24:03.640 --> 24:04.710
Unbelievable!

24:04.710 --> 24:06.440
Well, I had to go to my part-time job.

24:07.540 --> 24:09.580
Our job was just to find her, right?

24:10.340 --> 24:13.680
What happens between that brat and her old man
after that is none of our business.

24:14.390 --> 24:16.190
That poor man...

24:16.190 --> 24:18.440
such a devoted father.

24:18.440 --> 24:22.690
“My daughter, Lola, is all that remains
of her departed mother. She’s my only treasure.”

24:23.140 --> 24:25.410
“I’m begging you, please find her!”

24:28.320 --> 24:30.690
I feel quite sorry for him.

24:31.040 --> 24:32.850
That man...

24:32.850 --> 24:35.320
had the smell of an evil spirit.

24:35.320 --> 24:36.200
What?

24:36.200 --> 24:37.440
Really?

24:37.440 --> 24:38.950
So he’s...

24:38.950 --> 24:42.840
He’s not necessarily the one who’s been possessed.

24:42.840 --> 24:47.920
A powerful demon can affect people close by to it.

24:47.920 --> 24:52.180
See, this case is in our field after all.

24:52.180 --> 24:55.430
More people will die.

24:55.430 --> 24:58.020
What did you just say, Geezer?

25:02.620 --> 25:03.310
Kapaeru.

25:03.760 --> 25:04.810
I know.

25:10.440 --> 25:13.070
This is where Mr. Heinrich lives.

25:14.050 --> 25:15.300
I’ll smoke it out of the place.

25:15.300 --> 25:17.040
Don’t be so impatient.

25:17.040 --> 25:20.470
We’re not even sure if there is a demon in there.

25:20.470 --> 25:21.530
Geezer?

25:23.680 --> 25:25.670
Don’t sleep at this crucial time!

25:25.670 --> 25:26.830
Wake up, Geezer!

25:26.830 --> 25:28.120
It’s impossible.

25:28.120 --> 25:30.290
You can’t wake him once he’s asleep.

25:30.290 --> 25:31.570
Anyway...

25:31.570 --> 25:32.590
Enma?

25:39.900 --> 25:41.910
It’s coming for us.

25:41.910 --> 25:42.900
An ambush?

25:42.900 --> 25:43.980
That’s not important...

25:44.300 --> 25:46.190
It’s just saved us a lot of trouble.

25:46.190 --> 25:47.060
Yuki-chan!

25:52.200 --> 25:53.110
Son of a bitch!

25:55.540 --> 25:56.750
Halt!

25:56.750 --> 25:57.870
Boss!

26:00.750 --> 26:02.170
Yuki-chan! Hang in there!

26:02.170 --> 26:03.030
Kapaeru, go after it!

26:03.030 --> 26:03.700
I’m on it.

26:04.030 --> 26:05.430
Shit!

26:13.280 --> 26:16.760
From his appearance, it looks like
he hasn’t heard my phone message.

26:22.210 --> 26:23.100
Lola...

26:23.100 --> 26:24.880
Lola?

26:24.880 --> 26:25.970
Papa...

26:28.820 --> 26:30.110
Help me.

26:30.110 --> 26:31.200
What’s wrong?

26:31.200 --> 26:32.610
What’s happened?

26:32.610 --> 26:34.370
I-It can’t be?!

26:35.110 --> 26:36.560
Help me...

26:37.220 --> 26:38.330
I...

26:39.250 --> 26:42.620
I’ve become a vampire!

26:47.980 --> 26:50.340
The victim is in the same condition, isn’t he?

26:52.050 --> 26:53.360
Inspector Abashiri!

26:54.670 --> 26:56.300
No smoking at the crime scene.

26:59.780 --> 27:02.900
This case makes me wonder if there really is a vampire...

27:02.900 --> 27:04.310
What?

27:04.310 --> 27:06.340
You know, the article in the weekly magazine.

27:06.340 --> 27:08.940
A series of murders where the victims are drained of blood.

27:09.330 --> 27:12.440
It’s rumored that a modern-day vampire has been resurrected,

27:12.440 --> 27:14.080
and roams the city.

27:14.080 --> 27:15.090
You idiot!

27:15.090 --> 27:17.810
Don’t waste time repeating that crap, go interview someone!

27:17.810 --> 27:18.950
Yes, sir.

27:24.120 --> 27:27.330
I was sure it was her old man...

27:27.330 --> 27:30.560
but amazingly it looks like it was the missing daughter.

27:43.230 --> 27:45.340
It’s only a light wound,

27:45.340 --> 27:47.430
she’s just in a temporary state of shock.

27:47.430 --> 27:49.800
She should be fine in half a day.

27:49.800 --> 27:53.210
Thank goodness Miss wasn’t wounded seriously.

27:54.190 --> 27:57.180
Kapaeru, go ahead and check out the house.

27:57.180 --> 27:59.140
But Boss, Miss is still...

27:59.140 --> 28:02.120
We’ll blast that demon out of the daughter.

28:02.660 --> 28:04.410
Two of us should be enough.

28:06.090 --> 28:07.120
Okay...

28:15.750 --> 28:16.840
En... ma...

28:21.070 --> 28:22.590
Please leave us alone.

28:22.590 --> 28:26.950
We’ve got a witness who saw your daughter, Lorelai...

28:26.950 --> 28:31.200
entering a hotel with a Mr. Fukurokoji,
who was later found murdered there.

28:31.200 --> 28:34.850
Lola is not the type of girl who would
enter such a place with a man!

28:35.190 --> 28:38.910
As her father, I know you don’t want to believe this...

28:39.710 --> 28:45.470
but we have another witness who saw a woman
matching your daughter’s description...

28:46.290 --> 28:50.530
at the scene of a similar murder.
Same age, clothes and blonde hair.

28:50.530 --> 28:52.620
J-Just go away.

28:52.620 --> 28:55.380
It won’t take much time, we’ll just ask a few questions.

28:55.380 --> 28:57.430
I won’t repeat it!

28:57.430 --> 28:58.890
My daughter is not involved!

28:58.890 --> 29:00.530
I don’t care if you’re the police or not.

29:00.530 --> 29:02.620
Sir, obstructing an official investigation...

29:02.620 --> 29:05.630
It’s okay. We’ll come back another day.

29:19.310 --> 29:20.300
Papa...

29:21.090 --> 29:23.330
Whatever you might have done,

29:23.330 --> 29:26.610
I’m always on your side.

29:26.610 --> 29:27.870
Don’t worry.

29:27.870 --> 29:30.490
Papa! I don’t remember anything!

29:32.390 --> 29:34.630
But when I woke up...

29:34.630 --> 29:36.190
Calm down.

29:36.190 --> 29:40.120
All around me was
bright red with blood...

29:40.120 --> 29:41.370
and...

29:41.370 --> 29:43.530
The medicine will soon take effect.

29:45.230 --> 29:48.050
You don’t need to worry about anything now,
you need to rest.

29:49.080 --> 29:49.980
Hmm.

29:54.490 --> 29:55.810
Lola...

29:57.030 --> 29:59.190
The Boss is late...

29:59.190 --> 30:01.770
TOKYO KAGURAZAKA

30:02.100 --> 30:04.670
The professor is obviously covering for his daughter.

30:09.120 --> 30:10.100
Wait.

30:11.480 --> 30:12.260
Where are you going?

30:12.260 --> 30:13.590
None of your business.

30:14.980 --> 30:16.620
We’re the police. Answer the question.

30:16.620 --> 30:17.540
Like I care.

30:18.500 --> 30:20.000
Hey, stop! Freeze!

30:20.930 --> 30:22.270
Shall we chase after him?

30:22.270 --> 30:24.920
No, it would just be a waste of time.

30:27.580 --> 30:28.960
Vampires, eh?

30:28.960 --> 30:29.730
Sorry, sir?

30:29.730 --> 30:30.870
How ridiculous!

31:24.400 --> 31:25.590
Papa...

31:28.770 --> 31:29.780
Lola, what’s wrong?

31:29.780 --> 31:31.340
Behind you!

31:34.230 --> 31:35.740
There’s a child!

31:38.000 --> 31:40.750
Y-You’re from the detective agency...

31:42.790 --> 31:45.500
Don’t move. One false move and you’ll be burnt to death.

31:47.430 --> 31:48.510
What will you do to Lola?!

31:50.680 --> 31:51.880
Papa!

31:55.170 --> 31:56.310
Come on, show yourself.

31:56.310 --> 31:57.350
Help me...

31:57.350 --> 32:00.360
Come on, if you stay hidden, I’ll burn you to death.

32:02.240 --> 32:04.480
Stop it! Please stop it!

32:04.480 --> 32:05.880
Oh no, that’s not good.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.110
Papa!

32:07.110 --> 32:07.860
Don’t!

32:07.860 --> 32:09.650
Stay away from her!

32:16.930 --> 32:18.950
Kapaeru, don’t let them escape.

32:18.950 --> 32:19.750
Right!

32:19.750 --> 32:21.460
Papa, I’m scared.

32:21.460 --> 32:23.100
It’s okay.

32:23.100 --> 32:25.720
I promise I’ll protect you.

32:25.720 --> 32:26.870
Papa...

32:36.640 --> 32:39.640
Lola... My Lola.

32:45.620 --> 32:46.270
No!

32:46.270 --> 32:47.150
Yuki-chan!

32:47.150 --> 32:49.030
Move away from your father!

32:49.390 --> 32:50.530
The father?!

32:50.920 --> 32:53.280
The host, the one who’s possessed by a demon is!

32:57.060 --> 32:57.990
Damn!

33:16.760 --> 33:18.860
Lola...

33:18.860 --> 33:20.960
My Lola.

33:21.760 --> 33:23.200
Lola...

33:25.190 --> 33:26.740
Lola!

33:36.700 --> 33:37.530
Miss!

33:48.160 --> 33:50.230
Bastard, your opponent is here.

33:57.600 --> 34:00.260
Decide. Will you come with me...

34:00.260 --> 34:01.930
or be destroyed right here?

34:10.940 --> 34:12.570
So be it.

34:22.150 --> 34:25.250
Unless you corner its host, the demon never reveals itself.

34:26.060 --> 34:28.620
If only we knew it was her old man from the beginning.

34:30.030 --> 34:31.360
Damn.

34:31.360 --> 34:32.960
We made a terrible mistake.

34:35.770 --> 34:37.140
It was this.

34:37.140 --> 34:40.770
When I was bitten I smelled his tobacco.

34:40.770 --> 34:41.360
That’s how...

34:41.360 --> 34:42.570
Lola...

34:45.150 --> 34:50.690
Her old man was ready to risk his life to protect Lola from the Boss...

34:51.220 --> 34:52.220
But...

34:53.100 --> 34:54.810
I’ll never let you leave me again.

34:54.810 --> 35:00.090
I think he probably had feelings for her
as a woman, not just as his daughter.

35:00.090 --> 35:00.950
What?!

35:02.300 --> 35:06.560
But being a good man and father, this tore him apart.

35:07.120 --> 35:10.910
The demon exploited his turmoil to take possession of him.

35:11.560 --> 35:14.240
None of your no-good friends will ever bother us again...

35:14.840 --> 35:19.380
That’s why those who were around his precious daughter...

35:19.380 --> 35:25.450
Demon activity is often linked to the subconscious of its host.

35:25.450 --> 35:27.850
Oh, now you’re awake, Geezer!

35:28.410 --> 35:33.530
They really are a lot of trouble, these humans.

35:33.530 --> 35:35.270
It’s not just the humans.

35:36.750 --> 35:39.730
From now on, forever...

35:39.730 --> 35:41.430
just the two of us forever...

35:42.600 --> 35:43.860
forever...

35:54.910 --> 35:57.130
NOBUSUMA: ROT-PUS SUCK DEMON

36:11.400 --> 36:19.340
In the darkness of night, laying in bed
Tonight also, ever deeper decadence

36:19.340 --> 36:29.140
Smeared with grotesque make-up
Heart and body soaked, so upside-down

36:30.750 --> 36:33.510
Upside-down

36:36.220 --> 36:44.390
Make you, make me thrilled
Under the moonlight, honey

36:44.390 --> 36:51.980
Spit upon the bound-up heart

36:51.980 --> 36:59.710
Do the trip
Come on let’s dance, mired in depravity

36:59.710 --> 37:08.860
In return for this degradation,
unhidden jealous heart

37:08.860 --> 37:12.980
Body lusting for riot

37:27.220 --> 37:29.220
Next Episode Preview

37:30.750 --> 37:36.730
Born from a young lady’s anger,
hatred and sorrow.

37:36.730 --> 37:40.520
These transformed into a small
murderous demon who roams about at night.

37:40.520 --> 37:43.240
Sensing the acts of a demon...

37:43.610 --> 37:46.300
Enma and his team infiltrate
the downtown night-life area.

37:47.390 --> 37:51.370
Demon Prince ENMA, Episode 2, “Piguma.”

37:52.040 --> 37:55.540
Over there... something is lurking.

37:52.370 --> 37:52.410
PIGUMA
